Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||11-21-2001||10:02 AM||||I've got one installed in my '94 Bravada (had it for 2 years now).  What a blessing for our frigid/arctic Minnesota winters!<P>I also bought an alarm/keyless entry/remote starter for my Fiero, just haven't had the time/patience to install it (there are a lot of wires in that box you know!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">).<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
