Z||000008||Dumba$$||11-21-2001||04:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>I thought they could only be used on automatics?  Is it just illegal/not reccomended? If so I'm gonna get one, that'd be awesome.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>to use on a stick i belive you need to have a working parking brake  there is a sencor or somthing along that line that wont let it work if the e-break isnt pulled<P> <P>i have remote starts on my acura and on my fiero i love them  it gives me all the more reason to be lasy<P><P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>4.9 caddy engine for sale 30,000 miles complete with bubba joes mounts!!  $750||||reg||1
